#. <CLT 4>２度目の学級裁判が終わった翌朝…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The morning after the conclusion of the second class\n"
"trial...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクらはいつものように、いつもの食堂に集まり…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Everyone met up in the dining hall, just like always.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>いつもの朝食会が、いつものように始まる…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And I expected it to start like any other day.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>はずだったのだが…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>That's what I expected, but...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …今日は集まりが悪いべ。
#. 腐川っちと十神っちは相変わらず欠席だし…
msgctxt "0005 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Today's count kinda sucks, huh? Toko and Byakuya still\n"
"refuse to show up..."
msgstr ""

#. 朝日奈葵殿の姿も見られませんな…
msgctxt "0006 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid "And I haven't seen Miss Asahina anywhere."
msgstr ""

#. 朝日奈は腹痛らしい。
#. 今日は部屋で休んでいるそうだ。
msgctxt "0007 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"She said her stomach was hurting, so she's taking it\n"
"easy in her room for today."
msgstr ""

#. 珍しいですわね、いつも元気な彼女が…
msgctxt "0008 | CELES"
msgid ""
"That is rather unusual for her. Normally she is so\n"
"full of energy."
msgstr ""

#. だから余計に心配でな…
msgctxt "0009 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid "Which is exactly what makes me worry..."
msgstr ""

#. じゃあ、集まったのは、
#. この７人だけ…？
msgctxt "0010 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "So it's just the seven of us, then?"
msgstr ""

#. そう…みたいだね…
msgctxt "0011 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "It looks that way..."
msgstr ""

#. やっぱ、こういう時こそ、
#. 議長がビシッと締めてくんねーと！！
msgctxt "0012 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"It's times like this where the committee chairman\n"
"needs to get things going with a BANG!"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0013 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. 駄目か…
msgctxt "0014 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Or not...?"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0015 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. <CLT 4>石丸クンは昨日の一件以来、
#. まったく口を開いてない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0016 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Taka hasn't said a word since everything that happened\n"
"yesterday...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>一睡もしていないって事は、
#. その顔色が物語っていた。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0017 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>One look at his face showed he hadn't slept a wink\n"
"last night.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>やっぱり…大和田クンの事が……
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0018 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It must be because of Mondo...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>仲の良かった大和田クンが
#. 不二咲クンを殺したという事実…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0019 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The two of them became so close, and then he finds out\n"
"Mondo killed Chihiro...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>しかも、その大和田クンが…
#. 目の前であんな事になって…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0020 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And then...having to watch Mondo get...punished. And\n"
"nothing he could do about it...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>やっぱり…それがショックで……
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0021 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I can't even imagine what it must have done to him.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. それにしても…
#. この先どうなっちまうんですかね？
msgctxt "0022 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid "So, I mean...what's gonna happen now?"
msgstr ""

#. 出口も見つからず…助けも来ない状況で……
msgctxt "0023 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"We haven't found any way out, and we have no idea if\n"
"help's ever gonna come."
msgstr ""

#. ううっ…！
#. 言ってたら、ますます気が滅入ってきた…
msgctxt "0024 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid "Ngh! Now I'm all depressed just thinking about it..."
msgstr ""

#. …ここで仲良く暮らせばいいだけですわ。
msgctxt "0025 | CELES"
msgid ""
"We simply have to make the best of things—do our best\n"
"to get along and live here together in peace."
msgstr ""

#. 外の世界の事は忘れ、この生活を受け入れるのです。
#. それが、今のわたくし達の希望なのですから。
msgctxt "0026 | CELES"
msgid ""
"Forget about the outside world, and accept this new\n"
"life. That is the only hope we have now."
msgstr ""

#. そんな…こんな所でずっと暮らせなんて…
msgctxt "0027 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "What...? To live here forever...?"
msgstr ""

#. 食料も衣料も満たされている不自由のない生活…
#. どこに不満があるのですか？
msgctxt "0028 | CELES"
msgid ""
"Here we have every convenience. We have food, clothes,\n"
"our every need is seen to. Why are you dissatisfied?"
msgstr ""

#. 逆にお聞きしますが、
#. 外の世界には、他に何があると言うのです？
msgctxt "0029 | CELES"
msgid ""
"In fact, let me ask you this? What is it about the\n"
"outside world that you long for?"
msgstr ""

#. 競争、差別、犠牲、暴力…
#. 社会が大きくなればなるほど歪みもまた大きくなる…
msgctxt "0030 | CELES"
msgid ""
"Competition, discrimination, victimization and\n"
"violence... As society grows, so does its perversion."
msgstr ""

#. それならば、いっそここの方が…
msgctxt "0031 | CELES"
msgid "In which case, is our current situation not—"
msgstr ""

#. 外道天使☆もちもちプリンセス…
msgctxt "0032 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid "Demon Angel☆Pretty Pudgy Princess..."
msgstr ""

#. はい…？
msgctxt "0033 | CELES"
msgid "Hmm?"
msgstr ""

#. ドリル屋めぐちゃん、ウサ耳アマゾネス…
#. 猫ガール犬ボーイ、銀河王ジャスティスロボ…
msgctxt "0034 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"Meggy, the drill shop owner, the bunny-eared Amazon,\n"
"Catgirl Dogboy, Robo Justice the Galactic King..."
msgstr ""

#. それにそれに…ッ！
msgctxt "0035 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid "And...! And—!"
msgstr ""

#. とにかく…ここには２次元がなぁああい！！
msgctxt "0036 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid "What I mean is, there's no 2D here!"
msgstr ""

#. 欲望…そんなものを抱くから、
#. 黒幕に付け込まれるのですよ…
msgctxt "0037 | CELES"
msgid ""
"The mastermind puts such base desire to their\n"
"advantage, bending you to their will..."
msgstr ""

#. まぁ、とりあえずだな…
#. 石丸っちがアレな以上…
msgctxt "0038 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Okay, well, anyway... Since Taka's like, catatonic..."
msgstr ""

#. ここは年長者である俺が仕切んべ！！
msgctxt "0039 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"...as the oldest one here, I'm officially stepping up\n"
"to take the lead!"
msgstr ""

#. つー訳で、今日はみんな揃って、
#. 探索の日にすんぞ！！
msgctxt "0040 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"So! We're all gonna work together and spend the rest\n"
"of the day searching the school!"
msgstr ""

#. …探索？
msgctxt "0041 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Searching...?"
msgstr ""

#. だってよ、ほら…
#. 学級裁判も終わったんだし…
msgctxt "0042 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Well, I mean...since the class trial is over and\n"
"all..."
msgstr ""

#. 新たに行ける場所が増えているはず…か…
msgctxt "0043 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid "...there should be new places for us to investigate."
msgstr ""

#. そういう事だべ！！
#. 今度こそ手掛かりが見つかるかもしんねーだろ！
msgctxt "0044 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Yeah, that's the ticket! Maybe we'll find some kind of\n"
"clue this time!"
msgstr ""

#. では、食事の後、手分けして探索だ。
msgctxt "0045 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Then once we're done eating, let's split up and begin\n"
"looking around."
msgstr ""

#. …セレスもそれでよいな？
msgctxt "0046 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid "Do you have any problem with that, Celeste?"
msgstr ""

#. きっと、この暮らしをさらに豊かにしてくれる発見が
#. わたくし達を待っている事でしょう…
msgctxt "0047 | CELES"
msgid ""
"Hmm... There may well be a discovery waiting for us\n"
"which may further enrich our life here."
msgstr ""

#. いや…手掛かりを探しましょうって…
msgctxt "0048 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid "Er, no...the point is to look for clues."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…と、まとまりかけていた話をぶち壊したのは、
#. 遅れて来た<CLT><CLT 3>彼女<CLT><CLT 4>の存在だった。<CLT>
msgctxt "0049 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And just as we were starting to come together, <CLT><CLT 3>she<CLT><CLT 4>\n"
"barged in and ruined the conversation...<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 呼ばれて飛び出て、邪邪邪じゃーん！
msgctxt "0050 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "You called for me, and so I appear! Genocide—!"
msgstr ""

#. 呼んでない、呼んでない！
msgctxt "0051 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid "Ahh! Nobody called for you!"
msgstr ""

#. しかも…なんで腐川っちじゃなくて、
#. ジェノサイダーなんだべ！？
msgctxt "0052 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"What the...? How come it's Genocide Jill, and not\n"
"Toko?"
msgstr ""

#. この学校って素敵空間よね！
#. アタシみたいな殺人鬼が堂々としていられるんだもん！
msgctxt "0053 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"God, this place is just AMAZING! Finally a place I can\n"
"just be my murderous self!"
msgstr ""

#. だから、遠慮なく羽を伸ばさせてもらう事にしたの！
#. コソコソ隠れるのはやめッ！！
msgctxt "0054 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"Which is why I've decided to stop holding back and\n"
"spread my wings! No more hiding in a cave for me!"
msgstr ""

#. それに、アタシは戦わなければならないのよ…
msgctxt "0055 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Plus, I have another battle to fight!"
msgstr ""

#. 二重人格と言えば、古いドラマの安直な犯人設定…
#. そんな二重人格に対する誤解を打破する為に…
msgctxt "0056 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"The whole \"killer with a split personality\" thing is\n"
"sooo overdone. I gotta destroy that stereotype!"
msgstr ""

#. アタシは日夜戦わなければならねーんだよッ！！
msgctxt "0057 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"I'll fight all day and all night to murder those\n"
"totally slanderous cliches!"
msgstr ""

#. でも、オメー自身がそうだべ…
msgctxt "0058 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "But...you *are* a killer with a split personality..."
msgstr ""

#. グゥ…こいつがいなければ、
#. 生存率が１０％は跳ね上がるのに…！
msgctxt "0059 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"Gh—! If she weren't here, my chances of survival would\n"
"go up AT LEAST 10%!"
msgstr ""

#. あぁ…もっと声援を！
#. 確実にサイコーなアタシに、もっと声援を！
msgctxt "0060 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"C'mon, you gotta back me up here! Even the biggest\n"
"stars need the little people to hold them up!"
msgstr ""

#. ゲラゲラゲラゲラ！！
msgctxt "0061 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Kyeeehahahaha!"
msgstr ""

#. 何にしても、まずは食事にするぞ。
#. 腹が減っては何も出来ぬからな…
msgctxt "0062 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Well, whatever else we do today, first we should eat.\n"
"We can't do anything on an empty stomach."
msgstr ""

#. そうだね…
#. さっさと食べて、探索を始めよっか…
msgctxt "0063 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"You're right. Let's hurry up and eat so we can start\n"
"our investigation..."
msgstr ""

#. ゲラゲラゲラゲラッ！！
msgctxt "0064 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Kyeehahaha!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>殺人鬼と共に過ごす朝食…
#. そんな貴重かつ迷惑な食事を済ませた後…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0065 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>So we were forced to eat breakfast with a murderer.\n"
"And after our much needed but very annoying meal...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクらは、すぐに探索に取り掛かる事となった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0066 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...we set to work looking around the school.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
